@6689A's reflection underscores the broad spectrum of belief entwined with the concept of angels, highlighting how deeply personal convictions intertwine with interpretive choices. Delving into discussions about the substantial or metaphorical dimensions attributed to angelic intervention affirms a core principle within theological debate—that every soul crafts her/his path through a synthesis of reason and revelation.

